field.description:
Denormalized owning-tenant stamp copied from the parent RuleSet (defense-in-depth;
                the parent RuleSet stays the authoritative tenant boundary). Stamped at save time and
                backfilled by sweep#RuleChildTenantStamps for pre-existing rows.

